{"route":"/tutorials/data-foundations/welcome-to-data-analytics/","title":"Welcome to Data Analytics | Data Foundations Tutorial","description":"Data analytics turns questions and recorded evidence into explanations, decisions, and actions. This chapter shows the complete learning journey and the habits of a responsible analyst.","canonical":"https://datalearninghub.netlify.app/tutorials/data-foundations/welcome-to-data-analytics/","bodyAttrs":{"data-page":"tutorial-chapter","data-tutorial":"data-foundations","data-chapter":"welcome-to-data-analytics"},"mainHtml":"<main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"tutorial-layout\">\n<aside class=\"tutorial-sidebar\" id=\"tutorial-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-head\">\n<a class=\"tutorial-course-title\" data-bn=\"ডেটা ফাউন্ডেশন\" data-en=\"Data Foundations\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/\">Data Foundations</a>\n<button aria-label=\"Close chapter menu\" class=\"icon-button tutorial-drawer-close\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-close\" type=\"button\">×</button>\n</div>\n<label class=\"tutorial-sidebar-search\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Search chapters</span><input data-placeholder-bn=\"Chapter খুঁজুন…\" data-placeholder-en=\"Search chapters…\" id=\"tutorial-chapter-search\" placeholder=\"Search chapters…\" type=\"search\"/></label>\n<div class=\"tutorial-progress-mini\"><div><span data-bn=\"Course progress\" data-en=\"Course progress\">Course progress</span><strong id=\"tutorial-progress-label\">0/21</strong></div><div class=\"progress-track\"><span id=\"tutorial-progress-bar\" style=\"width:0\"></span></div></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"Course chapters\" class=\"tutorial-chapter-nav\"><div class=\"tutorial-module-links\"><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link current\" data-chapter-link=\"welcome-to-data-analytics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/welcome-to-data-analytics/\"><span>01</span><span data-bn=\"ডেটা অ্যানালিটিক্সে স্বাগতম\" data-en=\"Welcome to Data Analytics\">Welcome to Data Analytics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-and-statistics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-and-statistics/\"><span>02</span><span data-bn=\"ডেটা ও স্ট্যাটিস্টিকস\" data-en=\"Data and Statistics\">Data and Statistics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"observations-variables-and-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/observations-variables-and-values/\"><span>03</span><span data-bn=\"Observation, Variable ও Value\" data-en=\"Observations, Variables, and Values\">Observations, Variables, and Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"rows-columns-tables-and-datasets\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/rows-columns-tables-and-datasets/\"><span>04</span><span data-bn=\"Row, Column, Table ও Dataset\" data-en=\"Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets\">Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"categorical-and-numerical-data\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/categorical-and-numerical-data/\"><span>05</span><span data-bn=\"Categorical ও Numerical Data\" data-en=\"Categorical and Numerical Data\">Categorical and Numerical Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"discrete-and-continuous-data\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/discrete-and-continuous-data/\"><span>06</span><span data-bn=\"Discrete ও Continuous Data\" data-en=\"Discrete and Continuous Data\">Discrete and Continuous Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"measurement-scales\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/measurement-scales/\"><span>07</span><span data-bn=\"Measurement Scale\" data-en=\"Measurement Scales\">Measurement Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"welcome-to-data-analytics\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 1 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 1 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 1 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"ডেটা অ্যানালিটিক্সে স্বাগতম\" data-en=\"Welcome to Data Analytics\">Welcome to Data Analytics</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"ডেটা অ্যানালিটিক্স প্রশ্ন ও রেকর্ড করা evidence-কে ব্যাখ্যা, সিদ্ধান্ত ও action-এ রূপ দেয়। এই অধ্যায়ে পুরো learning journey এবং একজন দায়িত্বশীল analyst-এর অভ্যাস দেখানো হয়েছে।\" data-en=\"Data analytics turns questions and recorded evidence into explanations, decisions, and actions. This chapter shows the complete learning journey and the habits of a responsible analyst.\">Data analytics turns questions and recorded evidence into explanations, decisions, and actions. This chapter shows the complete learning journey and the habits of a responsible analyst.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 30 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"সহজ ভাষায় data analytics ব্যাখ্যা করুন।\" data-en=\"Describe data analytics in plain language.\">Describe data analytics in plain language.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Analytical workflow-এর ধাপগুলো চিনুন।\" data-en=\"Recognize the stages of an analytical workflow.\">Recognize the stages of an analytical workflow.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Evidence, opinion ও decision-এর পার্থক্য করুন।\" data-en=\"Distinguish evidence from opinion and decision.\">Distinguish evidence from opinion and decision.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"এই tutorial কার্যকরভাবে ব্যবহার করুন।\" data-en=\"Use this tutorial effectively.\">Use this tutorial effectively.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Data analytics কী করে\" data-en=\"What data analytics does\">What data analytics does</h2><p data-bn=\"Data analytics হলো useful question করা, relevant data সংগ্রহ বা খুঁজে নেওয়া, quality যাচাই, transform, pattern explore, appropriate method প্রয়োগ এবং evidence কী সমর্থন করে তা communicate করার disciplined process। এটি শুধু chart বানানো বা average calculate করা নয়।\" data-en=\"Data analytics is the disciplined process of asking a useful question, collecting or locating relevant data, checking its quality, transforming it, exploring patterns, applying appropriate methods, and communicating what the evidence supports. It is not merely making charts or calculating averages.\">Data analytics is the disciplined process of asking a useful question, collecting or locating relevant data, checking its quality, transforming it, exploring patterns, applying appropriate methods, and communicating what the evidence supports. It is not merely making charts or calculating averages.</p><div class=\"inline-example\"><strong data-bn=\"উদাহরণ\" data-en=\"Example\">Example</strong><p data-bn=\"একটি স্কুল attendance কেন কমেছে জানতে পারে। Analyst action recommend করার আগে date, class, weather, holiday এবং recording practice compare করেন।\" data-en=\"A school may ask why attendance fell. The analyst compares dates, classes, weather, holidays, and recording practices before recommending action.\">A school may ask why attendance fell. The analyst compares dates, classes, weather, holidays, and recording practices before recommending action.</p></div></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Analyst workflow\" data-en=\"The analyst workflow\">The analyst workflow</h2><p data-bn=\"Reliable workflow সাধারণত: decision define, analytical question তৈরি, data understand, clean ও validate, explore, analyze, interpret, communicate এবং document। বাস্তব কাজ iterative—একটি chart data issue দেখালে cleaning-এ ফিরে যেতে হয়।\" data-en=\"A reliable workflow usually follows: define the decision, translate it into analytical questions, understand the data, clean and validate, explore, analyze, interpret, communicate, and document. Real work is iterative: a chart may expose a data issue that sends you back to cleaning.\">A reliable workflow usually follows: define the decision, translate it into analytical questions, understand the data, clean and validate, explore, analyze, interpret, communicate, and document. Real work is iterative: a chart may expose a data issue that sends you back to cleaning.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"কাজ করে শেখা\" data-en=\"Learning by doing\">Learning by doing</h2><p data-bn=\"প্রতিটি chapter sequence অনুযায়ী পড়ুন, example চালান, একটি বিষয় পরিবর্তন করুন, exercise complete করুন এবং নিজের ভাষায় result ব্যাখ্যা করুন। লক্ষ্য definition মুখস্থ করা নয়; data দিয়ে repeatable reasoning তৈরি করা।\" data-en=\"Read each chapter in sequence, run the example, change one thing, complete the exercises, and explain the result in your own words. The goal is not memorizing definitions; it is building a repeatable way to reason with data.\">Read each chapter in sequence, run the example, change one thing, complete the exercises, and explain the result in your own words. The goal is not memorizing definitions; it is building a repeatable way to reason with data.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Analytical question\" data-en=\"Analytical question\">Analytical question</h3><p data-bn=\"যে প্রশ্ন data দিয়ে investigate করা যায় এবং যার population, measure, comparison বা time period নির্দিষ্ট।\" data-en=\"A question that can be investigated with data and has a defined population, measure, comparison, or time period.\">A question that can be investigated with data and has a defined population, measure, comparison, or time period.</p><small class=\"term-example\" data-bn=\"গত quarter-এ কোন product category-এর gross margin সবচেয়ে বেশি ছিল?\" data-en=\"Which product category had the highest gross margin last quarter?\">Which product category had the highest gross margin last quarter?</small></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Evidence\" data-en=\"Evidence\">Evidence</h3><p data-bn=\"কোনো claim-এর সঙ্গে relevant observed বা calculated information।\" data-en=\"Observed or calculated information relevant to a claim.\">Observed or calculated information relevant to a claim.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Insight\" data-en=\"Insight\">Insight</h3><p data-bn=\"শুধু number নয়, meaningful pattern-এর contextual explanation।\" data-en=\"A contextual explanation of a meaningful pattern, not just a number.\">A contextual explanation of a meaningful pattern, not just a number.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Recommendation\" data-en=\"Recommendation\">Recommendation</h3><p data-bn=\"Evidence, constraint, risk ও expected effect-এর সঙ্গে linked proposed action।\" data-en=\"A proposed action linked to evidence, constraints, risks, and expected effect.\">A proposed action linked to evidence, constraints, risks, and expected effect.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Complaint থেকে analysis\" data-en=\"From complaint to analysis\">From complaint to analysis</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"একজন manager বলেন, “Sales খারাপ।” এটি concern, analytical question নয়।\" data-en=\"A manager says, “Sales are bad.” That is a concern, not yet an analytical question.\">A manager says, “Sales are bad.” That is a concern, not yet an analytical question.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"“খারাপ” বলতে revenue, unit, margin নাকি target attainment বোঝায় তা clarify করুন।\" data-en=\"Clarify what “bad” means: revenue, units, margin, or target attainment.\">Clarify what “bad” means: revenue, units, margin, or target attainment.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Period ও comparison নির্ধারণ করুন।\" data-en=\"Define the period and comparison: this month versus last month or budget.\">Define the period and comparison: this month versus last month or budget.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Region, channel, product ও salesperson dimension নির্ধারণ করুন।\" data-en=\"Identify dimensions: region, channel, product, and salesperson.\">Identify dimensions: region, channel, product, and salesperson.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Return, discount বা missing transaction result distort করছে কি না যাচাই করুন।\" data-en=\"Check whether returns, discounts, or missing transactions distort the result.\">Check whether returns, discounts, or missing transactions distort the result.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Pattern ও practical consequence report করুন।\" data-en=\"Report the pattern and practical consequence.\">Report the pattern and practical consequence.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Better question: “Return বাদ দেওয়ার পর July-তে target-এর তুলনায় revenue gap কোন region ও product category explain করে?”\" data-en=\"A better question is: “Which regions and product categories explain the revenue gap against target in July, after returns?”\">A better question is: “Which regions and product categories explain the revenue gap against target in July, after returns?”</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Analytics decision-কে evidence-এর সঙ্গে যুক্ত করে।\" data-en=\"Analytics connects a decision to evidence.\">Analytics connects a decision to evidence.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Vague concern-কে measurable question করতে হয়।\" data-en=\"A vague concern must become a measurable question.\">A vague concern must become a measurable question.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Workflow iterative, perfectly linear নয়।\" data-en=\"The workflow is iterative, not perfectly linear.\">The workflow is iterative, not perfectly linear.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Interpretation ও documentation analysis-এর অংশ।\" data-en=\"Interpretation and documentation are part of analysis.\">Interpretation and documentation are part of analysis.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/ppc/section4/ppc41.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST/SEMATECH — First Steps in Data Analysis ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/SpecialPublications/1500-18/NIST.SP.1500-18r2.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST Research Data Framework ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><span></span><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-and-statistics/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"ডেটা ও স্ট্যাটিস্টিকস\" data-en=\"Data and Statistics\">Data and Statistics</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}